{"seq":3,"slug":"combine-kotlin-flow","title":"Combine 与 Kotlin Flow","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/implementations/combine-kotlin-flow","wordCount":341,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"combine-与-kotlin-flow\">Combine 与 Kotlin Flow</h1><p>Apple Combine 和 Kotlin Flow 是各自平台的原生 FRP 实现，设计理念与 Reactive Streams 规范高度对齐，但针对各自语言特性（Swift 协议/值语义，Kotlin 协程）做了适配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>Apple Combine</strong>（iOS 13+/macOS 10.15+）将响应式编程作为一等公民内置于 Apple 平台：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import Combine&#10;&#10;// Publisher: 发布值序列的协议&#10;protocol Publisher {&#10;    associatedtype Output  // 输出值类型&#10;    associatedtype Failure: Error  // 错误类型（Never = 不会出错）&#10;    func receive&lt;S: Subscriber&gt;(subscriber: S)&#10;        where S.Input == Output, S.Failure == Failure&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Subscriber: 接收值的协议&#10;protocol Subscriber {&#10;    associatedtype Input&#10;    associatedtype Failure: Error&#10;    func receive(subscription: Subscription)&#10;    func receive(_ input: Input) -&gt; Subscribers.Demand  // 返回需求量（背压）&#10;    func receive(completion: Subscribers.Completion&lt;Failure&gt;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Cancellable: 取消订阅的协议（对应 RxJS 的 Subscription）&#10;protocol Cancellable {&#10;    func cancel()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Combine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Publisher: 发布值序列的协议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Publisher</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    associatedtype</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  // 输出值类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    associatedtype</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 错误类型（Never = 不会出错）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">S</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Subscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: S)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> S.Input </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Output, S.Failure </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Failure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Subscriber: 接收值的协议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subscriber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    associatedtype</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    associatedtype</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Failure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Subscription)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input: Input) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Subscribers.Demand  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 返回需求量（背压）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">completion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Subscribers.Completion&#x3C;Failure>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Cancellable: 取消订阅的协议（对应 RxJS 的 Subscription）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cancellable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Combine 的类型系统使用 Associated Types，使背压信号在编译时就能检查：<code>Subscribers.Demand</code> 是强类型的需求量，而不是整数。</p>\n<p><strong>Kotlin Flow</strong>（协程扩展库）将响应式流与协程深度整合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.*&#10;&#10;// Flow: 冷流（Cold），每次 collect 从头执行&#10;fun coldFlow(): Flow&lt;Int&gt; = flow {&#10;    emit(1)&#10;    delay(100)  // 挂起函数，不阻塞线程&#10;    emit(2)&#10;    emit(3)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// suspend collect: 在协程作用域中消费&#10;suspend fun main() {&#10;    coldFlow().collect { value -&gt;&#10;        println(&quot;收到: $value&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.coroutines.flow.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Flow: 冷流（Cold），每次 collect 从头执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun coldFlow(): Flow&#x3C;Int> = flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(100)  // 挂起函数，不阻塞线程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    emit(3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// suspend collect: 在协程作用域中消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    coldFlow().collect { value -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"收到: $value\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Combine</th>\n<th>Kotlin Flow</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>Reactive Streams 兼容</td>\n<td>协程原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷热流</td>\n<td>Publisher/Subject 系列</td>\n<td>Flow(冷) / SharedFlow/StateFlow(热)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程切换</td>\n<td><code>.receive(on:)</code></td>\n<td><code>flowOn</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压</td>\n<td><code>Subscribers.Demand</code> 强类型</td>\n<td>协程挂起自然背压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消</td>\n<td><code>AnyCancellable</code></td>\n<td>协程 <code>Job</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>Apple 专属</td>\n<td>JVM/Android/多平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"combine-publisher-体系\">Combine Publisher 体系</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"import Combine&#10;&#10;// 内置 Publisher&#10;let just = Just(42)                        // 发出单值后完成&#10;let fail = Fail&lt;Int, URLError&gt;(error: .init(.badURL))&#10;let empty = Empty&lt;Int, Never&gt;()            // 立即完成，不发值&#10;let deferred = Deferred { Just(computeValue()) }  // 惰性创建&#10;&#10;// Subject: 命令式桥接（对应 RxJS Subject）&#10;let passthrough = PassthroughSubject&lt;String, Never&gt;()  // 无初始值&#10;let current = CurrentValueSubject&lt;Int, Never&gt;(0)       // 有初始值（对应 BehaviorSubject）&#10;&#10;// 订阅（使用 sink）&#10;let cancellable1 = passthrough&#10;    .sink(&#10;        receiveCompletion: { print(&quot;完成: \\($0)&quot;) },&#10;        receiveValue:      { print(&quot;值: \\($0)&quot;) }&#10;    )&#10;&#10;// 必须持有 AnyCancellable，否则立即取消&#10;var cancellables = Set&lt;AnyCancellable&gt;()&#10;passthrough.sink { print($0) }.store(in: &amp;cancellables)&#10;&#10;// 操作符链（与 RxJS 一一对应）&#10;let result = URLSession.shared&#10;    .dataTaskPublisher(for: url)&#10;    .map(\\.data)&#10;    .decode(type: Response.self, decoder: JSONDecoder())&#10;    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)  // 切换到主线程&#10;    .catch { _ in Just(Response.empty) }&#10;    .eraseToAnyPublisher()  // 擦除具体类型\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Combine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内置 Publisher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> just </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Just</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发出单值后完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fail </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fail</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, URLError</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><s