0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> input: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Subscribers.Demand {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"收到: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\\(input)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每处理一个再请求一个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> receive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">completion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Subscribers.Completion&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Never</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Kotlin Flow 的隐式背压（协程挂起）&#10;// 不需要显式 request()，挂起函数自然实现背压&#10;flow {&#10;    for (i in 1..1000) {&#10;        emit(i)  // 如果 collect 端慢，emit 会挂起等待&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;.collect { value -&gt;&#10;    delay(100)  // 慢消费者，但不会 OOM&#10;    println(value)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 需要缓冲时使用 buffer()&#10;flow { ... }&#10;    .buffer(capacity = 10)  // 生产者最多超前消费者 10 个&#10;    .collect { ... }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Kotlin Flow 的隐式背压（协程挂起）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不需要显式 request()，挂起函数自然实现背压</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (i in 1..1000) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        emit(i)  // 如果 collect 端慢，emit 会挂起等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.collect { value -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(100)  // 慢消费者，但不会 OOM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要缓冲时使用 buffer()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flow { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .buffer(capacity = 10)  // 生产者最多超前消费者 10 个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .collect { ... }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Combine</strong> 是 Apple 平台原生响应式框架，<code>Publisher</code>/<code>Subscriber</code>/<code>Cancellable</code> 协议与 Reactive Streams 语义对齐；<code>AnyCancellable</code> 的生命周期管理是关键，必须持有引用</li>\n<li><strong>CurrentValueSubject</strong> 对应 BehaviorSubject，<code>PassthroughSubject</code> 对应 Subject</li>\n<li><strong>Kotlin Flow</strong> 与协程深度整合，冷流（<code>flow {}</code>）是默认；<code>SharedFlow</code>（重放/多播）和 <code>StateFlow</code>（当前值）是热流变体</li>\n<li><strong>flowOn</strong> 声明上游生产线程，消费线程由 <code>collect</code> 所在协程决定；与 RxJS <code>subscribeOn</code> 类似</li>\n<li>Kotlin Flow 的背压通过协程挂起隐式实现，无需显式 <code>request(n)</code></li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Combine/Flow))&#10;    Combine&#10;      Publisher协议&#10;      Subscriber协议&#10;      AnyCancellable&#10;      PassthroughSubject&#10;      CurrentValueSubject&#10;    Kotlin Flow&#10;      Flow冷流&#10;      SharedFlow热流&#10;      StateFlow状态&#10;      flowOn线程切换&#10;      协程隐式背压&#10;    异同&#10;      Combine显式背压&#10;      Flow隐式背压&#10;      两者均支持操作符链\">mindmap\n  root((Combine/Flow))\n    Combine\n      Publisher协议\n      Subscriber协议\n      AnyCancellable\n      PassthroughSubject\n      CurrentValueSubject\n    Kotlin Flow\n      Flow冷流\n      SharedFlow热流\n      StateFlow状态\n      flowOn线程切换\n      协程隐式背压\n    异同\n      Combine显式背压\n      Flow隐式背压\n      两者均支持操作符链</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Combine 与 Kotlin Flow","id":"combine-与-kotlin-flow"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Combine Publisher 体系","id":"combine-publisher-体系"},{"level":2,"text":"Combine 与 SwiftUI 集成","id":"combine-与-swiftui-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Kotlin Flow 冷流与热流","id":"kotlin-flow-冷流与热流"},{"level":2,"text":"Kotlin Flow 的线程切换：flowOn","id":"kotlin-flow-的线程切换-flowon"},{"level":2,"text":"背压对比","id":"背压对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Project Reactor：响应式 JVM 编程库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/implementations/project-reactor"},"next":{"title":"背压策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/patterns/backpressure-strategies"}}